Funny", "Goof"], "long_description": "Welcome to Goof VR, the ultimate family-friendly multiplayer VR sandbox packed with creativity, mini-games, and hilarious fun.\n\nStep into vibrant, interactive worlds where you can explore, experiment, and create your own goofy adventures \u2014 together. Whether you're competing in multiplayer mini-games, discovering hidden surprises, or just causing harmless chaos online with friends, Goof VR is built for nonstop social fun.\n{912218251594670}\n\ud83c\udfae What You Can Do in Goof VR:\n\u2022 Explore colorful open environments\n\u2022 Play multiplayer mini-games\n\u2022 Hang out online with friends\n\u2022 Customize your character\n\u2022 Interact with playful physics-based objects\n\u2022 Unlock new cosmetics and items\n{1188123300783973}\nGoof VR is designed to be welcoming, energetic, and safe for all ages. With smooth VR controls, immersive environments, and social multiplayer experiences, every session feels alive and unpredictable.\n{925649376991183}\nNo stress. No pressure. Just pure goofy fun.\n\nJump in, get silly, and create your own adventure \u2014 together \u2014 in Goof VR.\n", "short_description": "Jump into Goof VR \u2014 a colorful multiplayer sandbox where creativity, mini-games, and goofy fun collide. Explore interactive worlds, play online with friends, customize your character, and discover surprises around every corner in this family-friendly VR adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://GoofVR.com/PrivacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://GoofVR.com/TOS", "publisher_name": "SupErWin Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://goofvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "externa